    "QuotaGlance" : {
      "comment" : "The app's own name, drawn as the home screen title and as the Mac panel's header. 「码量」 and \"QuotaGlance\" are two brand names rather than a translation of one another, but each language does use its own — so this is translated, exactly like CFBundleDisplayName in each target's InfoPlist.xcstrings. Do not derive one from the other.",
